[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_30]
Muffin!

[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_30_desc]
“With muffins in tow, you fly so high,”\n“A symbol of happiness, soaring the sky,”\n“Through trials and tribulations, you stand tall,”\n“A friend to one and to all.”

[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_30_TOOLTIP]
Citizens of Stratusburg is also thinking about Saint Derpy Hooves, but what exactly they are thinking about, Derpy will never know, nor need to know.

